## Dataset

This project uses the MOT17 benchmark dataset for multi-object tracking evaluation.

### Dataset Details

- Dataset: MOT17
- Source: MOTChallenge
- Task: Multi-Object Tracking
- Object Class: Pedestrians
- Detection Model: YOLOv8x
- - Tracker: ByteTrack & deepsort    #The tracker can be selected by changing the `tracker_type` variable in the notebook.
### Download

Download the dataset from the official MOTChallenge website and place it inside the `data/` directory.

